{"data": [{"author_id": "28164923", "created_at": "2026-11-08T20:02:24.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2119520936873361521"], "entities": {"urls": [{"description": "A group backed by Citadel Securities and Cboe is suing over the approval of single-stock perps.", "display_url": "on.wsj.com/4eneUwr", "end": 143, "expanded_url": "https://on.wsj.com/4eneUwr", "images": [{"height": 640, "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2119520940417486849/EskhXN9i?format=jpg&name=orig", "width": 1280}, {"height": 150, "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2119520940417486849/EskhXN9i?format=jpg&name=150x150", "width": 150}], "start": 120, "status": 200, "title": "A Popular New Bet Hailing From Cryptoland Sets Off a Wall Street Turf War", "unwound_url": "https://www.wsj.com/finance/regulation/a-popular-new-bet-hailing-from-cryptoland-sets-off-a-wall-street-turf-war-70e37095?reflink=e2twmkts", "url": "https://t.co/NavAGPaYOE"}]}, "id": "2119520936873361521", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 7978, "like_count": 17, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 3, "retweet_count": 2}, "text": "Perpetual futures, a popular new type of bet that started in the crypto world, is setting off a turf war on Wall Street https://t.co/NavAGPaYOE", "url": "https://x.com/WSJmarkets/status/2119520936873361521"}, {"author_id": "14499829", "created_at": "2026-11-08T19:45:01.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2119516560926650463"], "entities": {"hashtags": [{"end": 203, "start": 189, "tag": "MedSafetyWeek"}], "urls": [{"description": "Every day, medicines improve health and save lives. But even medicines that have been carefully tested and assessed before they reach your medicine cabinet can sometimes cause side effects. Recognizing and reporting these side effects is essential to making medicines safer for everyone.From 2 to 8 November 2026, WHO joins the global #MedSafetyWeek campaign to raise awareness of the importance of recognizing side effects from medicines and encourage patients, caregivers and healthcare professionals to report them.Why reporting side effects mattersSide effects can take many forms, from a skin rash or upset stomach to changes in sleep, mood or other unexpected symptoms. Some may appear shortly after starting treatment, while others develop after prolonged use, a change in dose or when several medicines are taken together.Although medicines undergo rigorous evaluation before they reach patients, not all potential side effects can be identified during clinical trials. Continuous monitoring ", "display_url": "bit.ly/4ktzgYr", "end": 185, "expanded_url": "https://bit.ly/4ktzgYr", "images": [{"height": 1250, "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2118735168529735680/siCn10PF?format=jpg&name=orig", "width": 1192}, {"height": 150, "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2118735168529735680/siCn10PF?format=jpg&name=150x150", "width": 150}], "start": 162, "status": 200, "title": "#MedSafetyWeek 2026: Don't ignore side effects. Report them. 2–8 November 2026", "unwound_url": "https://www.who.int/news-room/events/detail/2026/11/02/default-calendar/medsafetyweek-2026--don-t-ignore-side-effects.-report-them.-2-8-november-2026", "url": "https://t.co/VtjPxi24ke"}, {"display_url": "pic.x.com/l7i42XtKOq", "end": 227, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/WHO/status/2119516560926650463/video/1", "media_key": "7_2119515347602530304", "start": 204, "url": "https://t.co/l7i42XtKOq"}]}, "id": "2119516560926650463", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 4, "impression_count": 41620, "like_count": 128, "quote_count": 1, "reply_count": 7, "retweet_count": 37}, "text": "Medicines safety starts with you and me. \nWhether you’re a patient, healthcare professional, regulator, or company, we all have the power to make medicines safer https://t.co/VtjPxi24ke  \n\n#MedSafetyWeek https://t.co/l7i42XtKOq", "url": "https://x.com/WHO/status/2119516560926650463"}, {"author_id": "860158302", "created_at": "2026-11-08T19:08:01.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2119507248086999378"], "entities": {"urls": [{"description": "Get the latest insight and context on math and AI from Konstantin Kakaes, delivered straight to your inbox every week.", "display_url": "mailchi.mp/quantamagazine…", "end": 255, "expanded_url": "https://mailchi.mp/quantamagazine.org/transformation", "images": [{"height": 630, "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2118444806796111872/z7uiFkTS?format=jpg&name=orig", "width": 1200}, {"height": 150, "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2118444806796111872/z7uiFkTS?format=jpg&name=150x150", "width": 150}], "start": 232, "status": 200, "title": "Subscribe to Transformation", "unwound_url": "https://mailchi.mp/quantamagazine.org/transformation", "url": "https://t.co/rvyyWeldL6"}]}, "id": "2119507248086999378", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 7, "impression_count": 7622, "like_count": 23, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 6}, "text": "Keeping up with the latest in math and AI doesn’t have to be hard. Sign up for our Transformation newsletter, a new weekly digest tracking the rapid changes happening in mathematics — and how mathematicians are reckoning with them. https://t.co/rvyyWeldL6", "url": "https://x.com/QuantaMagazine/status/2119507248086999378"}, {"author_id": "32372834", "created_at": "2026-11-08T19:04:01.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2119506244255805721"], "entities": {"hashtags": [{"end": 101, "start": 82, "tag": "SciencePerspective"}], "urls": [{"description": "Carrion crows make decisions faster than monkeys and humans", "display_url": "scim.ag/4BLPcf3", "end": 126, "expanded_url": "https://scim.ag/4BLPcf3", "images": [{"height": 550, "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2119333375077216256/atyfK9Dc?format=jpg&name=orig", "width": 715}, {"height": 150, "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2119333375077216256/atyfK9Dc?format=jpg&name=150x150", "width": 150}], "start": 103, "status": 200, "title": "The cognitive power of the avian brain", "unwound_url": "https://www.scie