KXoKGK https://t.co/KXzDb832Tp", "url": "https://x.com/statnews/status/2119482746808533328"}, {"author_id": "15862891", "created_at": "2026-11-08T17:21:03.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2119480328758640862"], "entities": {"urls": [{"description": "Nature - Hundreds of engravings were spotted in a widely visited cave — some include signs of animation.", "display_url": "go.nature.com/4BHn4tn", "end": 170, "expanded_url": "https://go.nature.com/4BHn4tn", "images": [{"height": 600, "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2119480334211272704/bEKIUTQX?format=jpg&name=orig", "width": 1066}, {"height": 150, "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2119480334211272704/bEKIUTQX?format=jpg&name=150x150", "width": 150}], "start": 147, "status": 200, "title": "The palaeo cave art that hid in plain sight for 26,000 years", "unwound_url": "https://www.nature.com/articles/d41586-026-03585-z?utm_source=x&utm_medium=social&utm_campaign=nature&linkId=64338875&error=cookies_not_supported&code=a05f23e4-d364-4e48-afae-ef180eff3519", "url": "https://t.co/Ke8rvGZnwA"}]}, "id": "2119480328758640862", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 46, "impression_count": 29484, "like_count": 352, "quote_count": 5, "reply_count": 6, "retweet_count": 115}, "text": "Catalonia was thought to be almost devoid of palaeolithic art, but these engravings dating back 26,000 years have been found in a tourist hotspot\n\nhttps://t.co/Ke8rvGZnwA", "url": "https://x.com/Nature/status/2119480328758640862"}, {"author_id": "15862891", "created_at": "2026-11-08T15:45:00.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2119456158255636770"], "entities": {"urls": [{"description": "Nature - A clinical trial in three people tested a combination of gene-laden viruses and a drug.", "display_url": "go.nature.com/4z8SwhQ", "end": 214, "expanded_url": "https://go.nature.com/4z8SwhQ", "images": [{"height": 600, "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2119456163347501056/hRMDG9lM?format=jpg&name=orig", "width": 1066}, {"height": 150, "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2119456163347501056/hRMDG9lM?format=jpg&name=150x150", "width": 150}], "start": 191, "status": 200, "title": "Epileptic seizures nearly vanish after people receive experimental gene therapy in their brains", "unwound_url": "https://www.nature.com/articles/d41586-026-03566-2?utm_source=x&utm_medium=social&utm_campaign=nature&linkId=64339126&error=cookies_not_supported&code=6c870a32-c552-4781-ac94-651cd5e25943", "url": "https://t.co/iqNtN8iiZz"}]}, "id": "2119456158255636770", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 58, "impression_count": 29869, "like_count": 262, "quote_count": 3, "reply_count": 8, "retweet_count": 72}, "text": "Three people with epilepsy resistant to drug treatment saw the number of seizures they had per month fall by more than 90%, after gene-laden viruses were infused directly into their brains \n\nhttps://t.co/iqNtN8iiZz", "url": "https://x.com/Nature/status/2119456158255636770"}, {"author_id": "15862891", "created_at": "2026-11-08T13:58:47.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2119429426706346031"], "entities": {"urls": [{"description": "Nature - How similar are vertebrate and invertebrate sleeping behaviours? An analysis of spiders offers insights about how sleep evolved.", "display_url": "go.nature.com/4k0pGMD", "end": 152, "expanded_url": "https://go.nature.com/4k0pGMD", "images": [{"height": 600, "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2119429431408148480/qqiUc1sQ?format=jpg&name=orig", "width": 1066}, {"height": 150, "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2119429431408148480/qqiUc1sQ?format=jpg&name=150x150", "width": 150}], "start": 129, "status": 200, "title": "Spider snooze stages", "unwound_url": "https://www.nature.com/articles/d41586-026-03487-0?utm_source=x&utm_medium=social&utm_campaign=nature&linkId=64326863&error=cookies_not_supported&code=192abc28-7318-4e21-b208-c0c27d5144f9", "url": "https://t.co/g3oJSDxK6i"}]}, "id": "2119429426706346031", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 20, "impression_count": 1736